msgstr "Eliminar la cabecera HTTP powered by"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:208
msgid "Remove information about software used by your site. E.g., X-Powered-By: PHP/7.4.1"
msgstr "Elimina la información sobre el software utilizado por tu sitio. Por ejemplo: X-Powered-By: PHP/7.4.1"

