msgstr "Duración del bloqueo para IP con una URL trampa honeypot. Se establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:559
msgid "Enable User-Agent Blocking"
msgstr "Habilitar el bloqueo User-Agent"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:559
msgid "Activate User-Agent based blocking."
msgstr "Bloqueo por User-Agent."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:559
#, php-format
msgid "Manage User-Agent lists in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocking Rules</a> tab."
msgstr "Administre las listas de User-Agent en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Reglas de bloqueo</a>."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:560
msgid "User-Agent Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración User-Agent (min)"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:560
msgid "Block duration for IPs with a malicious User-Agent. Set to 0 for a permanent block."
msgstr "Duración del bloqueo para IP con un User-Agent. malicioso. Se establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:564
msgid "Verify Known Bots"
msgstr "Verificar bots conocidos"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:570
msgid "Enable reverse DNS verification for known crawlers (e.g., Googlebot, Bingbot)."
msgstr "Habilite la verificación de DNS inversa para rastreadores conocidos (por ejemplo, Googlebot, Bingbot)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:571
msgid "This prevents attackers from bypassing rules by faking their User-Agent. If an IP claims to be Googlebot but fails verification, it will be treated as a threat."
msgstr "Esto evita que los atacantes eludan las reglas falsificando su User-Agent. Si una IP afirma ser Googlebot pero no pasa la verificación, se considerará una amenaza."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:578
msgid "Verify AI Bots (CIDR)"
msgstr "Verificar bots de IA (CIDR)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:584
msgid "Enable IP CIDR verification for AI crawlers (e.g., OpenAI, ChatGPT)."
msgstr "Habilitar la verificación de IP CIDR para rastreadores de IA (por ejemplo, OpenAI, ChatGPT)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:585
msgid "Downloads official JSON IP lists from AI providers to verify their crawlers reliably, bypassing rDNS limitations."
msgstr "Descarga listas oficiales de direcciones IP en formato JSON de proveedores de IA para verificar sus rastreadores de forma fiable, sorteando las limitaciones de rDNS."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:592
msgid "Verify Monitoring Bots (IP List)"
msgstr "Verificar bots de monitoreo (lista de IPs)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:598
msgid "Enable IP verification for Monitoring Bots (e.g., Uptime Robot, Pingdom)."
msgstr "Habilite la verificación de IP para bots de monitoreo (p. ej., Uptime Robot, Pingdom)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:599
msgid "Downloads official IP lists from monitoring services to allow legitimate pings and block impersonators."
msgstr "Descarga listas oficiales de direcciones IP de servicios de monitoreo para permitir pings legítimos y bloquear a los impostores."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:613
msgid "Enable automatic blocking using the Spamhaus ASN DROP list."
msgstr "Habilite el bloqueo automático mediante la lista DROP de ASN de Spamhaus."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:614
msgid "Provides a powerful, auto-updating layer of protection against the worst networks on the internet. The list is refreshed daily."
msgstr "Proporciona una potente capa de protección con actualización automática contra las peores redes de internet. La lista se actualiza a diario."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:618
msgid "Manual ASN Protection"
msgstr "Protección ASN Manual"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:618
msgid "Enable blocking based on your custom Manual ASN Blocklist."
msgstr "Habilite el bloqueo según su lista de bloqueo de ASN manual personalizada."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:618
#, php-format
msgid "Manage your custom list in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocking Rules</a> tab."
msgstr "Administre su lista personalizada en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Reglas de bloqueo</a>."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:619
msgid "ASN Block Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración bloqueo ASN (min)"

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:619
msgid "Duration to block IPs from both manual and automated ASN lists. Set to <strong>0</strong> for a permanent block."
msgstr "Duración del bloqueo de IP de listas ASN manuales y automatizadas. Se establece en <strong>0</strong> para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:622
msgid "Block Ghost IPs"
msgstr "Bloquear direcciones IP fantasma"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:628
msgid "Automatically block IPs without ASN and Reverse DNS (Warning: Could cause false positives if rDNS is misconfigured by ISPs)."
msgstr "Bloquear automáticamente las direcciones IP sin ASN ni DNS inverso (Advertencia: podría generar falsos positivos si los proveedores de servicios de Internet tienen mal configurado el rDNS)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:636
msgid "Under Attack Mode"
msgstr "En modo ataque"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:643
msgid "Off (Normal Operation)"
msgstr "Apagado (Funcionamiento normal)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:644
msgid "Auto (Trigger on attack spikes)"
msgstr "Automático (Se activa ante picos de ataque)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:645
msgid "Manual (Always On / Panic Mode)"
msgstr "Manual (Siempre encendido / Modo pánico)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:648
msgid "Activates a global JS Challenge for all non-whitelisted visitors to protect the server."
msgstr "Activa un desafío JS global para todos los visitantes que no estén en la lista blanca para proteger el servidor."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:652
msgid "Trigger Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de activación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:652
msgid "Total blocks (from any module) required to auto-trigger the Panic Mode."
msgstr "Bloqueos totales (de cualquier módulo) necesarios para activar automáticamente el Modo Pánico."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:653
msgid "Detection Window (sec)"
msgstr "Ventana de detección (segundos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:653
msgid "The time window in seconds in which the block threshold must be reached."
msgstr "El intervalo de tiempo en segundos en el que se debe alcanzar el umbral de bloqueos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:654
msgid "Panic Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del pánico (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:654
