msgstr "Elige el tipo de desafío JS que se implementará durante un bloqueo por error 404."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:708
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:724
msgid "Single IP: Block Threshold"
msgstr "IP única: Umbral de bloqueo"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:708
msgid "Block a specific IP if it generates this many 404 errors."
msgstr "Bloquear una IP específica si genera esta cantidad de errores 404."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:709
msgid "404 Time Window (min)"
msgstr "404 Ventana de tiempo (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:709
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:725
msgid "Time period in which the error count must be reached."
msgstr "Periodo de tiempo en el que se debe alcanzar el recuento de errores."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:710
msgid "404 Duration (min)"
msgstr "404 Duración (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:710
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:726
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:738
msgid "How long the IP will be blocked."
msgstr "Por cuánto tiempo estará bloqueada la IP."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:714
msgid "Enable 403 Lockdown Mode"
msgstr "Habilitar modo 403 Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:714
msgid "If enabled, a global \"Lockdown\" will be triggered when too many 403 errors occur. During lockdown, ALL 403 visitors must solve a JS Challenge."
msgstr "Si se habilita esta opción, se activará un bloqueo global cuando se produzcan demasiados errores 403. Durante el bloqueo, todos los visitantes que reciban errores 403 deberán resolver un desafío de JavaScript."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:716
msgid "Total 403 errors allowed across the entire site..."
msgstr "Total de errores 403 permitidos en todo el sitio..."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:720
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during a 403 Lockdown."
msgstr "Elige el tipo de desafío JS que se implementará durante un bloqueo por error 403."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:724
msgid "Block a specific IP if it generates this many 403 errors."
msgstr "Bloquear una IP específica si genera esta cantidad de errores 403."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:725
msgid "403 Time Window (min)"
msgstr "403 Ventana de tiempo (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:726
msgid "403 Duration (min)"
msgstr "403 Duración (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:729
msgid "Enable Rate Limiting"
msgstr "Habilitar limitación Rate"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:729
msgid "Temporarily block IPs that make too many requests."
msgstr "Bloquear temporalmente las IP que realizan demasiadas solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:730
msgid "Request Limit"
msgstr "Límite de solicitudes"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:730
msgid "Number of requests to allow within the time window."
msgstr "Número de solicitudes a permitir dentro de la ventana de tiempo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:731
msgid "Time Window (seconds)"
msgstr "Ventana de tiempo (segundos)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:731
msgid "The time period in which the request count is measured."
msgstr "El período de tiempo en el que se mide el recuento de solicitudes."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:732
msgid "How long the IP will be blocked after reaching the limit."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo permanecerá bloqueada la IP después de alcanzar el límite."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:733
msgid "Define specific limits for different endpoints."
msgstr "Defina límites específicos para diferentes  endpoints."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:736
msgid "Login Failure Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de fallo de inicio de sesión"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:736
msgid "Number of failed logins to trigger a block."
msgstr "Número de inicios de sesión fallidos para activar un bloqueo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:737
msgid "Login Time Window (min)"
msgstr "Ventana de tiempo de inicio de sesión (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:737
msgid "Time period in which the failure count must be reached."
msgstr "Periodo de tiempo en el cual se debe alcanzar el conteo de fallas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:738
msgid "Login Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración del inicio de sesión"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:741
msgid "Auto-Whitelist Admins"
msgstr "Auto-Whitelist Admins"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:741
msgid "Automatically add administrator IPs to the whitelist on successful login."
msgstr "Agregar automáticamente las IP de administrador a la lista blanca luego de iniciar sesión exitosamente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:741
msgid "Ideal for admins who travel or have dynamic IP addresses."
msgstr "Ideal para administradores que viajan o tienen direcciones IP dinámicas."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:742
msgid "REST API User Protection"
msgstr "Protección del usuario de la API REST"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:742
msgid "Disable User Enumeration via REST API"
msgstr "Deshabilitar la enumeración de usuarios a través de la API REST"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:743
msgid "Prevent user enumeration via author scans"
msgstr "Prevenir la enumeración de usuarios mediante escaneos de autor"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:744
msgid "Strict Author Scan Block"
msgstr "Bloqueo estricto de escaneo de autores"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:746
msgid "Block author scans with 403 Error"
msgstr "Bloquear los escaneos de autores con un error 403"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:747
msgid "Instead of a 301 redirect, return a 403 Access Denied error. This will log the event and sum Threat Score points (as a 403 Error)."
msgstr "En lugar de una redirección 301, devuelva un error 403 de acceso denegado. Esto registrará el evento y sumará puntos a la puntuación de amenaza (como un error 403)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:757
msgid "Prevent WordPress from revealing whether a username or email exists on login failure."
msgstr "Evita que WordPress revele si existe un nombre de usuario o un correo electrónico en caso de error de inicio de sesión."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:758
msgid "Shows a generic error message for all login and \"lost password\" failures to prevent user enumeration."
msgstr "Muestra un mensaje de error genérico para todos los fallos de inicio de sesión y de \"contraseña perdida\" para evitar la enumeración de usuarios."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:763
msgid "Whitelist Login Countries"
msgstr "Países de inicio de sesión en la lista blanca"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:765
msgid "Select one or more countries that are allowed to access wp-login.php. If empty, all countries are allowed."
msgstr "Seleccione uno o más países con permiso para acceder a wp-login.php. Si deja el campo vacío, se permite el acceso a todos los países."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:770
msgid "XML-RPC Block Duration (min)"
msgstr "Duración Bloqueo XML-RPC (min)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:770
msgid "How long to block IPs that make suspicious XML-RPC requests. Set to 0 for a permanent block."
msgstr "Durante cuánto tiempo se deben bloquear las IP que realizan solicitudes XML-RPC sospechosas. Se establece en 0 para un bloqueo permanente."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:781
msgid "Enable automated protection against distributed XML-RPC attacks."
msgstr "Habilite la protección automatizada contra ataques XML-RPC distribuidos."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:782
#, php-format
msgid "When a sustained attack is detected, this mode will temporarily challenge all non-whitelisted traffic to <code>xmlrpc.php</code> with a JavaScript verifier, stopping the attack without flooding your block list. Manage endpoints that are currently in \"Lockdown Mode\" in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocked Endpoints</a> tab."
msgstr "Al detectar un ataque continuo, este modo verificará temporalmente todo el tráfico no incluido en la lista blanca de <code>xmlrpc.php</code> con un verificador de JavaScript, deteniendo el ataque sin saturar la lista de bloqueos. Gestione los endpoints que se encuentran actualmente en \"Modo de bloqueo\" en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Endpoints bloqueados</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:787
msgid "Lockdown Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:794
msgid "Number of unique IP blocks on <code>xmlrpc.php</code> needed to trigger the lockdown."
msgstr "Número de bloqueos de IP únicos en <code>xmlrpc.php</code> necesarios para activar lockdown."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:799
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:871
msgid "Lockdown Detection Window (min)"
msgstr "Ventana de detección de Lockdown (mín.)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:806
msgid "The time frame (in minutes) in which the threshold must be reached."
msgstr "El período de tiempo (en minutos) en el que se debe alcanzar el umbral."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:818
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:890
msgid "How long the lockdown mode will remain active (in minutes)."
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo permanecerá activo el modo  lockdown (en minutos)."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:829
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve to non-whitelisted XML-RPC traffic during lockdown."
msgstr "Seleccione el tipo de desafío JS que se aplicará al tráfico XML-RPC no incluido en la lista blanca durante el periodo de bloqueo."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:841
msgid "Enable automated protection against distributed brute-force attacks."
msgstr "Habilite la protección automatizada contra ataques de fuerza bruta distribuidos."

#. translators: %s is a placeholder
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:842
#, php-format
msgid "When a sustained brute-force attack is detected, this mode will temporarily challenge all non-whitelisted traffic to <code>wp-login.php</code> with a JavaScript verifier.Manage endpoints that are currently in \"Lockdown Mode\" in the <a href=\"%s\">Blocked Endpoints</a> tab."
msgstr "Al detectar un ataque de fuerza bruta, este modo verificará temporalmente todo el tráfico no incluido en la lista blanca de <code>wp-login.php</code> con un verificador de JavaScript, deteniendo el ataque sin saturar la lista de bloqueos. Gestione los endpoints que se encuentran actualmente en \"Modo de bloqueo\" en la pestaña <a href=\"%s\">Endpoints bloqueados</a>."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:847
msgid "Lockdown Event Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de evento Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:854
msgid "Total number of failed login attempts needed to trigger the lockdown."
msgstr "Número total de intentos fallidos de inicio de sesión necesarios para activar el lockdown."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:859
msgid "Lockdown Unique IP Threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de IP único de Lockdown"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:866
msgid "Minimum number of unique IPs that must contribute to the failed logins."
msgstr "Número mínimo de IP únicas que deben contribuir a los inicios de sesión fallidos."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:878
msgid "The time frame (in minutes) in which the thresholds must be reached."
msgstr "El período de tiempo (en minutos) en el que se deben alcanzar los umbrales."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:901
msgid "Choose the type of JS challenge to serve during a Login Page Lockdown."
msgstr "Seleccione el tipo de desafío JS que se mostrará durante un bloqueo de la página de inicio de sesión."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:905
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "Habilitar reCAPTCHA"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:907
msgid "Site Key"
msgstr "Cave de sitio web"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:908
msgid "Secret Key"
msgstr "Clave secreta"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:909
msgid "v3 Score Threshold"
msgstr "v3 Umbral de puntuación"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:913
msgid "Default Challenge Engine"
msgstr "Default Challenge Engine"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:916
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2918
msgid "JS Challenge (Managed / Checkbox)"
msgstr "Desafío JS (Gestionado / Casilla de verificación)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:917
#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:2919
msgid "JS Challenge (Automatic / Transparent)"
msgstr "Desafío JS (automático / transparente)"

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:921
msgid "Select the default engine used when serving challenges (e.g. Rate Limiting, Under Attack Mode, Lockdowns). Note: Geo Challenge remains separate."
msgstr "Seleccione el motor predeterminado que se utilizará al gestionar los desafíos (p. ej., limitación de tasa, modo «bajo ataque» o bloqueos). Tenga en cuenta que el desafío geográfico (Geo Challenge) permanece separado."

#: includes/class-advaipbl-settings-manager.php:925
